  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Rural Entrepreneurship, Investment and Trade in Papua New Guinea (STREIT PNG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of this programme is to increase sustainable and inclusive economic development of rural areas to be achieved through a combination of two integrated outcomes: 1) increasing the economic returns and opportunities from three selected value chains (cocoa, vanilla, fishery) while in parallel; 2) strengthening and supporting sustainable, climate proof transport and energy infrastructure development.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
